cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "triton-kernels: portable GPU kernels for LLM inference in OpenAI Triton"
abstract: >-
  An educational collection of fused and quantized GPU kernels for LLM inference
  written in OpenAI Triton (RMSNorm, SwiGLU, W8A16/W4A16 quantized GEMMs, and
  fused Mixture-of-Experts dispatch), each paired with a PyTorch reference, a
  correctness test suite, and a roofline analysis.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Azimml
repository-code: "https://github.com/Azimml/triton-kernels"
url: "https://github.com/Azimml/triton-kernels"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - triton
  - gpu
  - cuda
  - llm
  - inference
  - kernels
  - quantization
  - mixture-of-experts
